				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625977#post-4420853</guid>
				<title>Re: Other SCPs involved but only with core characteristics</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625977/bellerverse#post-4420853</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 11 Nov 2019 22:47:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Doctor Nails</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5293754</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><em>Note: I'm not a member of staff, but I have some things I'd like to point out.</em></p> <p>Wouldn't Iris be dead by this point? Her anomaly is just the camera and photos. Pretty sure she's not immortal. Maybe a decedent of Iris instead?</p> <p>That said, I do think introducing some classic immortal SCPs to the Bellerverse is a great idea. I myself am currently working on something with <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-076">Able</a>. Or maybe what became of the Church of the Broken God. Haven't decided yet.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
