					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Could SCP-2399(The Malfunctioning Destroyer/Great Red Spot) be involved?<br /> As in, possibly a religion or something based on the 'Red Eye of the Angry God' or something? It'd be cool if it eventually emerged and for some strange reason went to another planet instead of Earth. That'd be a quite interesting plot point or arc for a story.<br /> +1 btw!</p> 
