					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625977#post-3705856</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625977/bellerverse#post-3705856</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 09 Feb 2018 23:29:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>CyberKnight</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3318856</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Okay, I have some questions.<br /> If the Foundation survived through anomalous locations/anomalous travel systems, would that would imply extradimensional spaces also survived?<br /> The Wanderers' Library while is purposefully unexplained whether to it being it's own dimension or just using gateways, could have survived, right?<br /> If The Foundation had enough time to transport all these people off-world, could a few SCPs be utilized officially or unofficially (UnLondon Foundation personnel going rogue and making a conservation effort, as a example).<br /> I'm taking these as questions that weren't thought of, but it be nice if these were answered to prevent going against the creators original vision.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
